---
// Mini Preview: floating-action-button（悬浮操作按钮）-- 纯静态，零 JS，Gallery/Stream 用
---
<div class="w-full aspect-[16/9] bg-canvas border border-line rounded-card overflow-hidden p-4 relative">
  <div class="absolute inset-4 card-surface rounded-control p-3 flex flex-col gap-1.5">
    <div class="h-2 w-1/3 rounded-full bg-accent"></div>
    <div class="flex-1 rounded-md bg-tag-bg"></div>
  </div>
  <!-- 扩展菜单 -->
  <div class="absolute bottom-16 right-6 flex flex-col items-end gap-1.5 z-10">
    <span class="bg-dark-bg text-white text-[9px] px-2 py-1 rounded-pill shadow-card">新建文档</span>
    <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-accent-soft border border-accent-soft flex items-center justify-center text-xs text-accent-deep shadow-card">✎</span>
  </div>
  <!-- 主 FAB -->
  <div class="absolute bottom-5 right-5 w-11 h-11 rounded-full bg-accent text-white shadow-card flex items-center justify-center z-10">
    <span class="text-lg leading-none">＋</span>
  </div>
  <p class="absolute bottom-2 inset-x-0 text-center text-[9px] text-muted">页面上浮的常驻主操作</p>
</div>